  "visualReview": {
    "allSeventeenFieldPanelsReviewed": true,
    "allElevenFitComparisonsReviewed": true,
    "notes": {
      "rabbit": "Guided-16 improves the rectangular border, but the ears and silhouette remain rounded. Baseline has uneven border width and visible seams after fitting.",
      "stacked-hearts": "All four photographed crops contain the motif. Guided-16 and baseline fits lose the small hearts in large diagonal deformations; guided-32 and guided-8 retain more shape but show channels and distorted motifs. Guided-8 passes numerical checks despite visible defects.",
      "blue-yellow-checker": "Guidance straightens many classified boundaries; the fits remain uneven near the bottom/right border. Baseline fits a rounded, already distorted learned mask. Lower derived-mask error does not establish better artwork recovery.",
      "decorated-checker": "The newly supported guided-16 crop extends below the paper tip. Classification and fitting retain the displaced/jagged middle and lower border. The 0.81% agreement score does not certify this as a correct crop.",
      "field-review": "All seventeen source/field comparisons were inspected. Sharpening can improve outlines, but it cannot reconstruct missing bicycle/animal details or resolve incorrect paper identities. Some larger-radius results gain printed texture edges or merge checker cells."
    },
